# NOTE: /raw-data is deliberately NOT listed here — see the "NEVER git add These Files" section of
# CLAUDE.md. It holds the raw (unrounded, un-split) trace JSONs, which are far too large to commit
# (the JetMoE one alone is over GitHub's 100MB hard limit). Ignoring it hid it from file-tagging in
# Claude Code, so it is untracked-but-visible instead, the same arrangement as *.md / .claude/ /
# docs/. It must never be staged.
